class_name BuffIndex
extends Resource

## The list of buffs that exist. Generated by tools/data_builder.gd.
##
## This exists because of a real bug found on a live copy of the game. BuffPool used
## to build the pool by READING THE FOLDER — every .tres in data/buffs became a buff —
## and the data builder deletes orphans only in the copy it is run against. So a
## machine that had ever held an older build kept the deleted buffs on disk, and its
## game went on offering them: seven buffs that had been cut from the design, still in
## the rotation, invisible to every test because the test machine's folder was clean.
##
## Units never had that problem, and the reason is exactly this file. A unit is in the
## game because data/loadouts/roster.tres names it, so a stale unit .tres on disk is
## inert. Buffs now work the same way: this names them, and anything in the folder that
## is not named here is ignored.
@export var ids: Array[StringName] = []
